# Panes - tmux (actions/tmux/tmux_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**    -- Pane Maximize
**panes + h**      -- Pane Left
**panes + l**      -- Pane Right
**panes + up**     -- Pane Above
**panes + j**      -- Pane Below
**panes + -**      -- Pane H Split
**panes + \**      -- Pane V Split
**panes + w**      -- Pane Close
**panes + toggle** -- Pane Toggle
